  "_why": "LEVEL 10, FINALE (NIGHT25; forked by builder L from builder C's generated level10 to give each room its own GEOMETRY). C's ids, enemies (waves), pars semantics and LIMIT flags are kept. FINALE ONE (PISTOL ONLY): the grapple-and-slide room: an 8 m pit across the hall (a jump pad hops it, a grapple node hangs over it, a narrow bridge walks it), then a wall with a slide tunnel (the cut) and an east gap (the long way). FINALE TWO (NO DASH): the vertical room: a 4 m deck by a ramp, a 9 m deck by a long ramp, a pad onto the lower deck, walls 24 m. FINALE THREE (NO SLIDE): the wall-ride shaft: a flue of two 22 m walls to a 3.4 m catwalk (three wall jumps) over a weave of three baffles; the report prints both routes. THE DUEL (kind boss, boss rival) is RIVAL PRIME and THE ELDER FURNACE (boss final) is the ELDER KILN WYRM, each in its own arena by the boss hook (design.n25.bosses); the map rooms are stubs. Pars of the boss rooms are the composed-sim bot means x 1.2. Web coordinates: x east, y up, z SOUTH; metres.",
